  <name>Virtual Chat</name>
  <summary>Turn any audio into a conversation</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Virtual Chat is a subscription-based Linux app that transcribes input and
      output audio from system or Bluetooth-linked devices (headsets, phones,
      etc.) into a real-time chat format.
    </p>
    <p>
      Powered by OpenRouter's AI models, it can provide an AI assistant with
      custom prompts, automatic chat summaries, and more. Perfect for podcasters,
      streamers, and content creators.
    </p>
    <p>
      Audio is only sent once speech is detected, and API keys are stored
      securely in the system keyring.
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>Note:</em> This is a paid subscription app with a free trial available.
      Requires an internet connection.
    </p>
  </description>

